<title>SWEDEN: Finland air cargo volumes drop 2.9 pct in Feb.</title>
<headline>Finland air cargo volumes drop 2.9 pct in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's domestic and international airports handled 6,919 tonnes of freight in February, a 2.9 percent drop from the same month a year earlier, Finland's civil aviation administration said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The administration published the following figures about airport activity for the month.</p>
<p>				    Feb 1997    Pct change v Feb 96</p>
<p> Cargo (in tonnes)	     6,919	   -2.9</p>
<p> Mail (in tonnes)		1,590	   +4.3</p>
<p> Passengers		    849,960	   +5.1</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
</text>
